    {
      "id": "cold-open",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "晚上十点，手机突然弹出一条通知：明早的航班取消了。你真正需要的不是一个会点按钮的 AI，而是有人先看懂影响，再把可选方案整理到你面前。Qwen UI Agent 的新演示，就从这个意外开始。",
      "headline": "航班取消之后，AI 能接住多少事？",
      "diagram": "host-event",
      "transition": "notification-match",
      "sfx": ["notification", "character-think"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.cold-open", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-night"}, "layout": {"preset": "host-cold-open"}, "camera": {"framing": "medium", "movement": "push-in"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "notice", "mode": "host-cold-open", "hostOnScreen": true, "asset": "char_surprised.jpg", "action": "注意到航班取消通知"},
      "visual": {"kind": "host", "accent": "red", "notification": "CA1517 · 7月26日 · 已取消", "cueIndexes": [0, 2, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-flight-demo"]
    },
    {
      "id": "official-demo",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "通知不是终点，而是触发信号。演示里，Agent 先读取取消信息和相关日程，再主动提出查找替代交通方案。注意这个顺序：先理解影响，再给计划；涉及重新预订时，它把决定权交回用户。",
      "headline": "从通知触发，而不是等你重新下指令",
      "diagram": "official-demo",
      "transition": "device-follow",
      "sfx": ["data-pulse"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.official-demo", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-paper"}, "layout": {"preset": "host-demo"}, "camera": {"framing": "medium-close", "movement": "follow"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "investigate", "mode": "host-demo", "hostOnScreen": false},
      "visual": {"kind": "demo", "demoStart": 0, "demoEnd": 18, "callouts": ["通知触发", "理解影响", "请求确认"], "cueIndexes": [0, 2, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-flight-demo", "qwen-ui-agent-report"]
    },
    {
      "id": "proactive-loop",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "这背后多了一层轻量 Harness。它把现实信号、用户上下文和持续状态交给 Planner：感知事件，推演影响，准备方案，等待确认，然后继续执行。小兰现在指的这条线，才是主动服务真正发生的地方。",
      "headline": "主动，不等于擅自行动",
      "diagram": "proactive-loop",
      "transition": "signal-trace",
      "sfx": ["connector-draw", "character-point"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.proactive-loop", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-paper"}, "layout": {"preset": "host-diagram"}, "camera": {"framing": "wide", "movement": "pan"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "bridge", "mode": "host-diagram", "hostOnScreen": true, "asset": "xiaolan-pointing.png", "action": "沿主动服务路径指向确认节点", "rig": {"system": "xiaolan-rig-v1", "pose": "pointing", "action": "point-emphasis", "lipSync": "voice-rms"}},
      "visual": {"kind": "flow", "nodes": ["现实信号", "理解影响", "准备方案", "用户确认", "跨端执行"], "emphasis": 3, "cueIndexes": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-report"]
    },
    {
      "id": "hybrid-actions",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "接下来它并不执着于模拟人的每一次点击。适合界面的步骤用 GUI，搜索和结构化数据可以走 API，处理文件时再切到 CLI；多个确定动作还能批量发出。真正的升级，是为目标选择更合适的动作通道。",
      "headline": "GUI、CLI、API：为目标选择动作通道",
      "diagram": "hybrid-demo",
      "transition": "channel-split",
      "sfx": ["code-focus", "soft-tick"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.hybrid-actions", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-paper"}, "layout": {"preset": "host-demo"}, "camera": {"framing": "wide", "movement": "static"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "investigate", "mode": "host-demo", "hostOnScreen": false},
      "visual": {"kind": "demo-channels", "demoStart": 18, "demoEnd": 43, "channels": ["GUI", "CLI", "API", "BATCH"], "cueIndexes": [0, 1, 3, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-report", "qwen-ui-agent-flight-demo"]
    },
    {
      "id": "cross-platform",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "更关键的是，任务不会被锁在一块屏幕里。手机负责通知和确认，浏览器或 DeepSearch 查资料，电脑更新表格和会议，再把结果送回相关的人。平台变了，但同一份任务状态没有断。",
      "headline": "设备在切换，任务状态不掉线",
      "diagram": "cross-platform",
      "transition": "orbit-to-path",
      "sfx": ["data-pulse", "character-present"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.cross-platform", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-paper"}, "layout": {"preset": "host-diagram"}, "camera": {"framing": "wide", "movement": "pan"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "bridge", "mode": "host-diagram", "hostOnScreen": true, "asset": "xiaolan-presenting.png", "action": "把四个平台连成同一条任务路径", "rig": {"system": "xiaolan-rig-v1", "pose": "presenting", "action": "explain-open", "lipSync": "voice-rms"}},
      "visual": {"kind": "platforms", "nodes": ["MOBILE", "BROWSER", "DEEP SEARCH", "COMPUTER"], "center": "STATEFUL TASK", "cueIndexes": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-report"]
    },
    {
      "id": "long-horizon",
      "duration": 14,
      "speaker": "xiaolan",
      "dialogue": "这类跨端任务很长，局部点对并不代表最后做完。技术报告把在线强化学习推进到超过一百个交互步骤，并用大约一万个并行环境加速训练。重点不是数字更大，而是专门训练中途观察、修正和继续。",
      "headline": "长任务的难点，是中途还能继续",
      "diagram": "long-horizon",
      "transition": "step-rise",
      "sfx": ["data-rise"],
      "states": [],
      "scene": {"id": "scene.long-horizon", "background": {"id": "background.observatory", "variant": "warm-paper"}, "layout": {"preset": "metric-progression"}, "camera": {"framing": "wide", "movement": "push-in"}},
      "hostNarrative": {"role": "investigate", "mode": "host-diagram", "hostOnScreen": false},
      "visual": {"kind": "steps", "steps": 100, "environments": 10000, "labels": ["观察", "修正", "继续", "完成"], "cueIndexes": [0, 2, 3, 4]},
      "citations": ["qwen-ui-agent-report"]
